From 376d4894a8542b0fe22b7a59f580e8f5692d0661 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 18:29:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 23/29] mobileshell: One UI look for the task switcher

Window pictures on the cards (podglad wayfire plugin, only the app on
screen is captured again at each opening, ~130 ms of compositor time),
the older cards stacked and shaded on the left, the icon over the top
edge, a cross on each card, the app count pill, the outlined close all
pill, the three dots menu with the Recents settings page and a row of
suggested apps (last used, not open), which that page turns off.

Signed-off-by: Artur <ganggg111@gmail.com>
---
